  "intended_use": "Edge pre-filter that decides whether a vibration window is worth reporting over the mesh. Alerts are always fused with other evidence and reviewed by a human operator.",
  "limitations": [
    "Trained only on synthetic data; field recordings from a Phase-1 pilot are required before operational reliance.",
    "Underground activity is only observable when surface coupling is sufficient; deep workings may be invisible to surface geophones.",
    "Animal and vehicle classes are the main false-alarm sources; fusion with PIR and acoustic channels reduces but does not eliminate them."
  ],
  "ethical_considerations": "The model classifies ground vibration, not people. It processes no audio content, images or personal identifiers (POPIA s19 data minimisation)."
